# Purpose

Define the high-level operational architecture of the Catering ERP.

---

# Business Identity

A catering company delivers **events**, not simply food.

Food, logistics, staffing, procurement, equipment, transportation, finance, and customer communication all exist to support successful event execution.

---

# Central Business Aggregate

The primary operational aggregate is the **Event**.

All operational planning and execution revolves around the Event.

Examples include:

* Menus
* Production
* Procurement
* Inventory
* Staff
* Equipment
* Logistics
* Finance
* Documentation
* Communication

