# Architectural Direction

The Event Workspace is the primary operational experience of the Catering ERP.

Supporting domains enrich the Event Workspace rather than competing with it.

The business application is designed around business operations instead of technical modules.

---

# Guiding Statement

> **People do not use Catrack to manage data. They use Catrack to run their catering business.**
